          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Four destinations sit in a top bar — inbox, people, board, authority — so the horizontal space belongs to the work. Ada is docked on the right of every screen, including onboarding, as the escape hatch: anything the UI can do, you can also just ask for. Goals are a tree you expand, the inbox is a stack you clear, and everything else — profiles, files, the record, hiring — is a detail view reached from a row, never a place you navigate to.",
