    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "HMXH0",
      "x": 2900,
      "y": 3190,
      "name": "DOC 02b Board — exec collapsed",
      "width": 900,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "02b — the same Board with Ada collapsed to a rail.\n\nThe dock costs 380px, and on the Board that was a whole kanban column. Collapsed, the fourth column (DONE THIS WEEK) comes back and the tree keeps its width. The rail still carries her state: working dot, a count of what is waiting on you, and the ⌘J toggle — so she is never gone, only quiet.\n\nOpen question for the build: does collapse persist per surface (Board collapsed, People expanded) or globally? Per-surface matches how crowded each one actually is."
    }
  ],
